<title>USA: Sen. Hatch sees budget amendment debate next week.</title>
<headline>Sen. Hatch sees budget amendment debate next week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senate Judiciary Committee Chairman Orrin Hatch said Monday the balanced budget amendment to the Constitution could go to the Senate floor for debate next week.</p>
<p>The Republican from Utah added that he believed there were enough votes in the Senate to pass the amendment.</p>
<p>If the amendment passed the Senate, Hatch said he believed it would also pass the House.</p>
</text>
